  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes a hybrid quantum‑enhanced kernel logistic regression (QEKLR) using a ZZFeatureMap and fidelity quantum kernel with ≤4 qubits, evaluated on small datasets (40–336 samples). The method reports 100% accuracy on synthetic and Iris datasets and 94.87% accuracy with MCC = 0.88 and AUC‑ROC = 0.98 on the Statlog Heart Disease dataset, but performance is comparable to classical methods and experiments are conducted only on simulators.",
